# Keep the devcontainer workflow build context small. The Dockerfile only needs
# dependency manifests/source used by make predev; the live workspace is bind-
# mounted when the container starts.
*

!.devcontainer/
!.devcontainer/Dockerfile
!Makefile
!frontend/
!frontend/package.json
!frontend/bun.lock
!adapters/
!adapters/python/
!adapters/python/**

adapters/python/.venv
adapters/python/__pycache__
adapters/python/**/*.pyc
